How it works:
Run the program first and choose an option from the menu:
1 for Stone
2 for Paper
3 for Scissors
4 to Exit
The computer randomly picks its move. The winner of the round is decided using the rules,i.e.,stone beats scissors,scissors beats paper,paper beats stone.
Scores are updated and displayed after every round.
Choose 4 anytime to exit and see the final score and overall result.
